      "writtenOn": "2024-11-01T01:16:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear Mu-Le,\ndo you know if the \u0027no ongoing notificaiton\u0027 is accounced and/or POC of it?\n\nI tested with Play, but its download notification __revives__ when dismissed. There\u0027s an explicit cancel button instead. What\u0027s the recommended practice with the new enforcement? Should we follow the Play?\nI\u0027m asking this I haven\u0027t seen the notification says \u0027dismiss to quit\u0027.",
      "parentUuid": "6500f97f_7ab1a95e",
      "revId": "0c2d4654beb81e23f3afa975258f2f4e35ca8dbc",
